AND SO, WHATCHA DOING?

67
00:02:16,169 --> 00:02:17,403
WE'RE RIDING PONIES,

68
00:02:17,403 --> 00:02:18,738
[WESTERN DRAWL]
BUT IT MAKES
A FELLER HANKER

69
