FOR THE REAL THING.

70
00:02:19,706 --> 00:02:21,975
YOU KNOW, LIVIN' OUT
ON THE OPEN RANGE.

71
00:02:21,975 --> 00:02:23,510
RIDIN', ROPIN', BRANDIN'.

72
00:02:23,510 --> 00:02:25,845
BUSTIN' BRONCOS
AND BREAKIN' WIND
WITH YOUR AMIGOS

73
00:02:25,845 --> 00:02:27,113
UNDER THE WESTERN SKIES.

74
00:02:27,113 --> 00:02:29,015
HECK, WE COULD EVEN
FORD A STREAM!

75
00:02:29,015 --> 00:02:30,350
[NORMAL VOICE]
I DON'T EVEN KNOW
WHAT THAT MEANS,

76
00:02:30,350 --> 00:02:31,751
BUT IT SOUNDS FUN.
[SPITS]

77
00:02:31,751 --> 00:02:33,019
OH, AND SPITTING.

78
00:02:33,019 --> 00:02:45,865
HEY, WHERE'S PERRY?

79
00:02:45,865 --> 00:02:48,601
YEAH, AND SHE WAS LIKE,
"OH, NO, YOU DIDN'T."

80
00:02:48,601 --> 00:02:50,937
AND--OH.
THERE YOU ARE, AGENT P.

81
00:02:50,937 --> 00:02:52,772
OOPS.

82
00:02:52,772 --> 00:02:56,509
I FORGOT TO TURN OFF
THE LASER SHARKS AGAIN,
DIDN'T I? MY BAD.

83
00:02:56,509 --> 00:02:59,812
ANYWAY, THE EVIL
DR. DOOFENSHMIRTZ
IS AT IT AGAIN.

84
00:02:59,812 --> 00:03:03,349
NOT ONLY DOES HE HAVE
3 BOOKS ABOUT INSECTS
OVERDUE AT THE LIBRARY,

85
00:03:03,349 --> 00:03:05,685
BUT HE'S CORNERED THE MARKET
ON ALUMINUM SIDING,

86
00:03:05,685 --> 00:03:07,453
AND HE'S HOLED UP
 IN HIS WATER FORTRESS

87
00:03:07,453 --> 00:03:09,422
ON LAKE WINIMAKATINKAHAHA.

88
00:03:09,422 --> 00:03:10,924
HA HA--I LOVE SAYING THAT.

89
00:03:10,924 --> 00:03:12,425
YOU MUST FIND OUT
WHAT HE'S UP TO

90
00:03:12,425 --> 00:03:17,330
AND PUT A STOP TO IT.
 THAT IS ALL.

91
00:03:17,330 --> 00:03:20,833
[BEEPING]

92
00:03:20,833 --> 00:03:25,605
♪ DOOFENSHMIRTZ EVIL
INCORPORATED ♪

93
00:03:25,605 --> 00:03:28,174
AH, PERRY THE PLATYPUS.

94
00:03:28,174 --> 00:03:30,843
AS USUAL,
YOUR TIMING IS UNCANNY.

95
00:03:30,843 --> 00:03:35,949
AND BY UNCANNY,
OF COURSE, I MEAN
COMPLETELY CANNY!

96
00:03:35,949 --> 00:03:38,017
SO, PERRY THE PLATYPUS,

97
00:03:38,017 --> 00:03:42,188
LET ME INTRODUCE TO YOU
MY ASSISTANT VANESSA.

98
00:03:42,188 --> 00:03:43,756
WHATEVER.

99
00:03:43,756 --> 00:03:45,325
[MUSIC PLAYING]

100
00:03:45,325 --> 00:03:47,727
[CHUCKLES]
SHE'S NEW.

101
00:03:47,727 --> 00:03:49,996
ANYWAY,
AT THIS VERY MOMENT,

102
00:03:49,996 --> 00:03:52,465
TERMITES FROM ALL OVER
THE TRI-STATE AREA

103
00:03:52,465 --> 00:03:54,467
