TERMITE-CONTROLLING HELMET.

105
00:03:57,203 --> 00:03:58,404
SEE? SEE?

106
00:03:58,404 --> 00:04:00,173
THEY HAVE CUTE LITTLE
HELMETS JUST LIKE ME.

107
00:04:00,173 --> 00:04:03,710
[CHUCKLES] I DON'T WANT
TELL YOU HOW LONG IT TOOK
TO PUT THEM ALL ON.

108
00:04:03,710 --> 00:04:06,212
SO, WATCH THIS.

109
00:04:06,212 --> 00:04:10,049
[WHIRRING]

110
00:04:10,049 --> 00:04:12,885
SOON I WILL HAVE THEM
DEVOUR ALL OF THE WOOD

111
00:04:12,885 --> 00:04:15,521
IN THE ENTIRE
TRI-STATE AREA.

112
00:04:15,521 --> 00:04:19,926
THEN EVERYONE WILL HAVE
TO BUY ALUMINUM SIDING
FROM ME. HA HA HA HA!

113
00:04:19,926 --> 00:04:23,162
♪ DOOFENSHMIRTZ
ALUMINUM SIDING ♪

114
00:04:23,162 --> 00:04:25,365
YOU'RE THROUGH,
PERRY THE PLATYPUS.

115
00:04:25,365 --> 00:04:29,235
THROUGH! NOW IT IS TIME
FOR PLATYPUS FLAMBE!

116
00:04:29,235 --> 00:04:30,970
HA HA HA HA!

117
00:04:30,970 --> 00:04:34,941
VANESSA, DID YOU BRING
THE LITTLE WOODEN HEAD
