118
00:04:34,941 --> 00:04:36,843
SO, ANYWAY, I WAS LIKE,
"YOU TALKING TO ME?"

119
00:04:36,843 --> 00:04:39,345
AND SHE WAS LIKE
ALL IN MY FACE AND--

120
00:04:39,345 --> 00:04:40,446
TERMITES!

121
00:04:40,446 --> 00:04:44,284
AAH!

122
00:04:44,284 --> 00:04:47,387
[WHIRRING]
