123
00:04:47,387 --> 00:04:48,388
AAH!

124
00:04:48,388 --> 00:04:50,256
[MOOING]

125
00:04:50,256 --> 00:04:51,391
AAH!

126
00:04:51,391 --> 00:04:53,426
