127
00:04:53,426 --> 00:04:55,695
WOW, A STAMPEDING
HERD OF CATTLE.

128
00:04:55,695 --> 00:04:57,163
THEY'RE HEADED
STRAIGHT FOR TOWN!

129
00:04:57,163 --> 00:04:58,498
WE'VE GOT
TO DO SOMETHING!

130
00:04:58,498 --> 00:05:00,366
